{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/animated_gif.gif?t=1748683924\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An avian story of a bird and a chatty blade unfurls its feathers! A feathery roguelite for the SNES era makes its debut!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/Crow_Attack.gif?t=1748683924\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Take up arms against the evil Crow sorcerer who brainwashed your troupe.  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You must save them all.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidalgo Bladewing and his companions return to their favorite ramen spot following a perilous mission, only to be confronted by the vengeful void crow, Omega Wing. Two years later, Hidalgo must rescue his fallen companions from the clutches of this ruthless old foe\u2014with the help of a chaotic, brash-talking sword.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/ForestRun.gif?t=1748683924\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defeat hordes of deadly Tengu</strong> in fast-paced, skill-driven combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elegant roguelite zones</strong> that test your reflexes and grit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Die, retry, grow stronger,</strong> and overcome impossible odds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voice-acted cast</strong> and dynamic dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Absorb Meza souls</strong> to unlock powerful upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wield the Yutameta scythe</strong> and strike from afar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your weapon</strong> \u2013 Hammer, Blade, Whip, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully animated opening cutscene</strong> sets the tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Transform into the Void Crow</strong> and demolish the Tengu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a vibrant world</strong> full of color and personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take flight and glide</strong> through peaceful sky sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect elemental powers</strong> \u2013 Flame, Lightning, Wind, and Poison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hybrid soundtrack</strong> mixing synthwave and JRPG influences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-drawn pixel art</strong> with expressive animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight a possessed egg yolk</strong> crawling with ancient evil and being all gross and stuff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/Sunset.gif?t=1748683924\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;When it comes out, I will play it&quot; - Shuhei Yoshida, President, Sony Playstation (SIE)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/Shu.png?t=1748683924\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2228490?t=1748683924","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748683924","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748683924","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748683924","categories":[{"descriptio