p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Absorb Meza souls</strong> to unlock powerful upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wield the Yutameta scythe</strong> and strike from afar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your weapon</strong> \u2013 Hammer, Blade, Whip, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully animated opening cutscene</strong> sets the tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Transform into the Void Crow</strong> and demolish the Tengu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a vibrant world</strong> full of color and personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take flight and glide</strong> through peaceful sky sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect elemental powers</strong> \u2013 Flame, Lightning, Wind, and Poison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hybrid soundtrack</strong> mixing synthwave and JRPG influences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-drawn pixel art</strong> with expressive animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight a possessed egg yolk</strong> crawling with ancient evil and being all gross and stuff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/Sunset.gif?t=1748683924\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;When it comes out, I will play it&quot; - Shuhei Yoshida, President, Sony Playstation (SIE)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/Shu.png?t=1748683924\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Monster Theater"],"dlc":[2793260],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor